WEBVTT

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.140
Oh, the pure delightful flavor
of the Sacred power.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.730
Even an appetizer is this good.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.860
Now, for the main dish.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.740
I'll have you, Alma Tandoji.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.910
You are distinctively different
from all the other Dark Stones.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:45.420
Ah yes, channeling Ruri's powers
through the pendant,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:51.260
which is the very raw stone pouring out
the powers of the Sacred Seven,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.590
you hold the seven miraculous abilities
from the heaven.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:00.770
Yes, you're the only one who carries
all of them within your body.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.850
That is who you are.

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:08.570
Now, to complete this full course,
I'll have you, Miss Ruri, for dessert.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:13.240
Then I'll take my seat with the gods!

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.410
There's no place for you
among the gods!

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:24.830
I'll beat you down to hell!

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.220
Along with this trash.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.300
Fei!

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:41.220
Ruri, time to transform.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:45.690
This power... There's no way
I'm gonna let Kenmi have it.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:49.820
It's everything you've worked for...
saving Aoi, helping everyone.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.860
It's the crystallization
of your wishes.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.190
No.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.950
It's always been inside you.
From the very beginning.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.530
You allowed me in.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.830
It's the crystallization of all the emotions
as we fought together.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:07.870
That's the Sacred Seven.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.590
My Soul...

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:15.010
Everything that I have...

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.430
I give to you.

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:37.740
You have given meaning to my life.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:41.870
Thank you.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.450
Alma...

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:51.380
I'm going!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.380
Yes.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.420
Fei!

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:57.630
Kijima...

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:02.800
Don't look the other way.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:09.190
Fei!

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.740
Oh, you little trash. You'll do me good.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:25.870
Dammit!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:31.920
What's wrong? Can't hit back? Loser!

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:37.670
The Sacred power of such high purity
is overwhelming, isn't it?

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.470
That's not your power!

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:43.600
You stole it from Hung!

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.680
For Hung, I'm gonna kill you!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:04:00.950
Kijima. It's wasteful that an empty guy like you
holds onto these powers.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:05.080
Such an enormous power is worthless
unless it's held by one with principle, like me.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.080
Don't make me laugh!
It's all for your personal gain.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.750
You're one to talk, trying to carry out
your personal vendetta against me.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.830
Shut up!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:19.840
Oh, too bad. I thought I could dispose
of this tiny trash.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:20.970
You coward!

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:23.800
I'm just effectively using resources.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.970
Naito! Don't worry about me, take out Kenmi!

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:34.980
Manami?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.690
Miss Ruri!

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.030
You girls came for me?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.490
Dammit!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.660
Only thing left is
hand-to-hand combat.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:50.000
You, you're quite the swinger.
You do it so well.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.160
Ready...

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.710
Go!

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.630
<i>Mr. Kagami.</i>

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.840
I've located Miss Ruri.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.890
We're escorting her out with five members.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:12.850
Good job.
Evacuate from the facility with Miss Ruri.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.100
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.810
I'm going to search for Miss Aoi.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.480
Oni!?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.780
So you are Oni-gawara.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.950
Aoi! You're awake, oni!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.410
I have to take care of something.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:30.910
Will you help me?

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.580
Oh, oni?

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.880
What's wrong? Weren't you going to kill me?

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:41.210
Is that all you've got? Huh?

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.550
That's not it!
Naito's worried about me!

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.390
Because of me...

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:53.600
I'm...

00:05:58.520 --> 00:05:59.560
I'm...

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.620
...a powerless nuisance.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.790
Kenmi...

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.580
...kill me.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:22.500
That way Naito can fight freely.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.550
Oh, you've got guts, for trash.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:30.510
Alright, I'll grant you your wish.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:31.720
Fei!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.650
Alright.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:40.440
Let's begin.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:48.570
Fei!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.450
You'll see your brother soon enough.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.620
It's gonna be alright.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.550
What great timing, Tandoji.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.760
Kenmi!

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.840
Naito!

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:13.640
Now to devour your body.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.980
What's this, oni? This sensation?

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:30.070
It's the power of malice carried
by the Dark Stones, and it's growing.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.760
Naito!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.210
Disappear.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:46.560
Kenmi, me, all should disappear.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.090
It's Oni-gawara.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.800
I'll go collect him.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.270
Oh, how awesome!

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.940
Awesome!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:31.480
Oh, so this is the ultimate power
of the Sacred Seven.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.450
Give it to me!

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.910
I'll devour it!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.120
This guy...

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.480
Oh yes, this power.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.190
I want it...

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.400
I want it!

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:22.160
Disappear, disappear,disappear!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.500
Such great power.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.540
But if this continues...

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.090
Oh, Prince Charming
on his white horse, oni.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.300
Junior!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.220
Miss Aoi!

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.970
No need for formalities.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:43.010
Kagami, escort me.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:45.730
As you wish.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:05.040
Don't cry.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.370
Fei.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.260
Fei!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:19.050
Don't do this.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.470
Don't fight!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:26.430
Why can't I change?

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:29.980
<i>Now to devour your body.</i>

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.190
Fei!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.230
Don't fight!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.030
Naito?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:44.950
Your power is the same
as Miss Ruri's. It's defensive.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.960
You sent that power to me, didn't you.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:54.420
And now I have the best coating
in my possession.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:03.050
I've helped Kenmi instead of killing him.

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:07.640
You're too weak.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:13.650
I'm such a worthless idiot.
I should just vanish.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.610
I feel I'm invincible.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:23.280
I'm still here, this is not the end!

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.290
It's useless, stop struggling.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:37.170
And just let me eat you!

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:45.470
In just a little while the ultimate power
of the Sacred Seven will be mine!

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.180
After eating Alma...

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.430
... and Aoi...

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.930
... and Ruri!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.390
I'm going to devour you all!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:57.360
I let those twins survive for this very day.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:03.530
The Aibas, you self-righteous, cheap bastards!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:07.990
You didn't even try to understand
my worthy goals.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:10.410
That's why I killed you!

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.460
Ripping you apart!

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.420
Burning you up!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.330
With these hands!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:19.550
No, this hand?

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.430
My hands?

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.520
You killed Ruri's parents!

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:35.520
I just eliminated my obstacles!

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.440
No matter how hard,
there's a way to shatter you!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.950
Focusing all powers into one point.

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:49.410
With ultimate speed!

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:56.540
You're finished!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.430
What the hell is he?!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.600
This shouldn't have happened.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.570
I had everything in my grasp.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:28.160
This can't be.

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:30.580
Right, Fei?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.120
Well, it appears it's the end.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:47.260
I'm going to give you my
and Hung Yuk's malice.

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:51.140
This'll grant you your wish.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.440
Fei!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.570
Naito.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:29.630
Disappear, everyone.

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:31.720
Fei!

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:40.020
Fei, with your malice,
you'll destroy the world.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:47.490
Fei.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:04.750
Fei!

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.670
I'm going to help you.

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.300
I don't need your help.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.350
Everyone's getting hurt... my brother,

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.220
and Naito,

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.270
it's all my fault.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.730
I shouldn't be here.

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:28.730
That's why!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:30.360
Everything!

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.200
Everything disappear!

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.660
Fei, don't do it!

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:54.390
Dammit, I'm useless now, when it counts!

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.340
No.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.680
Your powers are needed.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:05.400
You must save her.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:07.360
With Alma.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:10.650
Alma knows what's in Fei's heart.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.820
But he needs help.

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:17.200
He needs you, you've been
with Fei all along.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.240
But I...

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:20.410
Accept my power.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:27.630
Your memories, I take into me.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:31.630
My Soul...

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.880
I give to you.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:42.140
Remove that core of malice from her.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:44.190
Right.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.780
Tandoji!

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:53.780
Naito!

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.610
Lend me your powers.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:59.620
If I can only get to where Fei is.

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:01.450
I can do it with my powers.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.290
Alright!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.290
I'll take care of things outside!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.290
Please, take care of Fei.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.220
Get away, don't come near me!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:17.390
Everyone should break!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.720
I have to stop this attack.

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:28.310
The power to entrap everything!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:34.400
What?

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.280
If this falls, it'll hit everyone.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.620
Why?

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:49.920
Why are you stopping me?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.500
Let me make it all disappear!

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.930
I know. You can't stand it anymore.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.720
If you didn't have this power,
you wouldn't have to suffer.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:10.350
If only you hadn't been born
with this power.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:19.030
But you know, I met some people.
They opened their arms to me.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.910
Then, before I was aware,
something had changed.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.960
I found out that there was a purpose
for my powers.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:34.880
And I felt this was the place
I should belong to.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:38.300
I wanted to protect these people.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:44.890
There are people for you, too.
Those who are opening their arms for you.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.390
Fei.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.960
Let's go home, together.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:31.640
I heard your voices.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:34.020
I could always hear your voices.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.440
I'm sorry, Ruri.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.740
I'm so sorry you had
to fight by yourself.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.610
Aoi...

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.740
I...

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:55.500
Oh Ruri. How unfair, you've grown up.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.420
Miss.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.920
It's been a long journey, oni.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:52.890
Maids, we're together again!

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:54.850
Yes sir.

00:22:10.030 --> 00:22:14.790
We've certainly accepted
our mothers' wishes.

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:17.880
Tandoji!

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.130
You've got to hurry!

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:28.140
I can walk with my head held high.

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:30.800
So...

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:52.700
Too bad. You've failed.

00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:57.920
Well, bye.

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.060
It's chilly.

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:30.660
Hi everyone, I'm Ruri's younger sister Aoi!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:32.120
Hello!

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:34.910
Who does she think she is?

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:37.200
Nice to meet everyone!

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:39.920
She's annoying, she's annoying, she's annoying.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:47.720
Oh, Ruri and Aoi!

00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:50.800
Thank you for letting us use
your fabulous boat.

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:54.510
With such an amazing vessel,
we can go anywhere.

00:23:54.640 --> 00:23:55.890
I know!

00:23:55.970 --> 00:23:58.730
How about we go abroad
for our next stone hunting trip?

00:23:58.730 --> 00:23:59.940
For real?

00:23:59.940 --> 00:24:02.100
What a trip!
Nice idea!

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:11.570
Oh yeah, a foreign stone,
I'm into that, oni!

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.830
The end, for now! Oni!
